# Builder-only CSR surface

- Players apply CSR via https://individualcontributor.dev/builder/ — not a patcher site.
- Publish **`ic-layer-v1`** under `builder/` + `builder/manifest.json`.
- GitHub Pages = silent CDN (redirect `index.html` + `builder/`). Keep it that way.
- Do **not** reintroduce PPF, RomPatcher, or per-disc full-image downloads for players.
- Changelogs live under `bases/<csr|csr-plus|highwind>/CHANGELOG.md`.
- Workspace placeholders use `.gitkeep`, not README.md.
- After changing a published base **id**, remind: rebuild Field packs in Final-Fantasy-7-Modding.
